WEBVTT

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.812
niso ženski problemi,

00:09:00.812 --> 00:09:03.450
ampak so družinski problemi.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:06.473
Sarah in Emily sta med srečnimi,

00:09:06.473 --> 00:09:08.242
ker imata možnost izbire,

00:09:08.242 --> 00:09:10.779
koliko hočeta delati.

00:09:10.779 --> 00:09:13.608
Milijoni moških in žensk

00:09:13.608 --> 00:09:16.945
morajo biti obenem hranilci in skrbniki,

00:09:16.945 --> 00:09:20.485
da lahko zaslužijo, kolikor potrebujejo,

00:09:20.485 --> 00:09:23.033
in mnogi od teh delavcev se mučijo.

00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:25.917
Skupaj krpajo varstvene možnosti,

00:09:25.917 --> 00:09:27.090
ki so neprimerne

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.501
in pogosto res nevarne.

00:09:29.501 --> 00:09:34.191
Če sta hranilstvo
in oskrba res enakopravna,